# REST API = Representational State Transfer Application Programming Interface

# Named Parameter = the placement can be random

# Decoding = Converting data into a specific format so that it can be stored or transmitted in an appropriate format
# Encoding = Converting encoded data back into data that can be processed by a program

# Socket Exception = exception that happen when there's low level networking from operating system
# ClientException = error at HTTP connection (example: DNS failed to find server address or disconnection suddenly)
# TimeoutException = maximum time of waiting because the internet connection too slow (RTO)
# IOException
# HTTPException
# 

# try-catch (expression) = connected to each other. preventing application from crashing when something unexpected happens

# ping www.google.com = to check internet connection

# shared preferences = store in local system and temporary. e.g = dark and light mode

# RAM = Random Access Memory